'''Rider the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 459
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Rider the Cat
|name2 = Heroic Spirit Rider Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Heroic Spirit Rider Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit acts as sort of a cheaper, more ranged [[A Gift of Cats (Rare Cat)|A Gift of Cats]].

This unit is surprisingly useful in [[Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)|Oncoming Maelstrom]], due to the huge difference between [[Divine Cyclone]]'s range (70) and Rider's range (190). But remember to stack many of them, since they all die in one hit from the Cyclone. But after you get better crowd controllers for angels she comes irrelevant.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

